** Birth enrollment (mastering fundamental)
Every note is born into the review pool — learn it all or
deliberately suspend it, no third state. The single seam is the
public `manifolding-atlas-create' above (both file and heading
branches funnel through it), so specialized creators (recipes,
dictionary, routines, journal, unfolding-notes) need no individual
wiring. Notes under =admin/= (unfolding-notes, Journal, admin
queues) are metadata or logs, not knowledge cards, and are excluded
by path — reviewing them would pollute sessions with machinery.
Anything enrolled later by hand (mark-review, attest, encounter)
uses the same init path, so enrollment is idempotent by
construction: existing stages are never downgraded here, only
missing ones are set.

Load-order note: files compile in mind-map order, so every call below is guarded
by `fboundp'. At creation time in a live session everything is
loaded; the guards only protect batch/headless partial loads.

