PLIST's :description; body text under each ** option becomes that
option's entry in PLIST's :option-descriptions alist
(OPTION . DESCRIPTION). OPTIONS stays a flat list of option strings
for backward compatibility. A :PROPERTIES:...:END: drawer holding the
:ID: right after the heading is skipped."
  (with-temp-buffer
    (insert-file-contents file)
    (goto-char (point-min))
    (unless (re-search-forward "begin_src" nil t)
      (goto-char (point-min))
