** Mastering fragment
The STAGE picker is clamped, not free: capture-time picks may only
land on UNSEEN (declined to engage — honest, unenrolled-warm) or
AWARE (birth state). Anything higher is downgraded to AWARE with a
message pointing at attestation, because review machinery cannot
evidence understanding and the picker must not let a keystroke fake
it. Legacy values map one-way: REVIEW/TODO → AWARE, SUSPEND →
STATUS=SUSPENDED, WARNING → unenrolled guard (no writer emits these
anymore; the branches exist so old drawers still parse).
